WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:21.980
I just got a message about this great
project.

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:27.960
This device would help millions of people in the rehabilitation process.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:31.240
Consumers saving money and investors earning.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:32.020
But there's a problem.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:36.120
Ideas need opportunities and investors to make them happen.

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:42.000
So how can we help?
Come, follow me!

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:55.280
This is the EU investment portal. It works like an online
speed-dating platform for EU projects

00:00:55.280 --> 00:01:01.280
and investors worldwide; and finds the
perfect match.

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:08.479
What is really great about it: it's free easy-to-use, safe
one-stop shop with no middleman

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.760
It's not only for big projects even small ones can apply.

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:15.090
I just found a match.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:17.760
There's a potential investor.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:21.480
So, are you an investor or a project promoter?

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:26.240
Do you want to try?  Then, all you have to do is register.

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:29.000
The next success story may be yours.

